sgp 2

given
  e1 = ellipse(O)
    a1: a(e1) = 5
    b1: b(e1) = 3
  point A
    x_A: x(A) = 5
    y_A: y(A) = 0
  k1 = circle(A)
    r1: r(k1) = 4

construct
  B = meet(e1, k1)

find
